%% Enterprise view (TOGAF business, application and technology layers).
flowchart TB
  subgraph Business["Business layer"]
    team[Complaints and risk team] --> process[Monitor complaint volumes, products and timeliness]
    process --> outcome[Earlier detection of complaint spikes; data ready for ML triage]
  end
  subgraph Application["Application layer"]
    job[Ingest job: complaints-ingest]
    api[Report API]
    db[(Complaints database)]
  end
  subgraph Technology["Technology layer"]
    desk[Desktops: Docker, Podman, Rancher]
    k8s[Kubernetes / OpenShift: CronJob + Deployment]
    cloud[AWS ECS + RDS · Azure Container Apps + Postgres Flexible · GCP Cloud Run + Cloud SQL]
  end
  process --> api
  job --> db --> api
  job --> desk
  job --> k8s
  job --> cloud
